      "id": "normal_callback_pump",
      "finding": "ServerMgr.Update calls IPlatformService.Update; SteamPlatform.Update checks SteamServer.IsValid and calls SteamServer.RunCallbacks; a nonzero ServerPipe is passed to Dispatch.Frame.",
      "boundary": "A static call chain does not prove the remote frame loop is currently running or that a particular callback has arrived. ServerMgr frame updates are guarded by runFrameUpdate.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "module": "Assembly-CSharp.dll",
          "method": "System.Void ServerMgr::Update()",
          "metadataToken": "0x06007AB6",
          "ilRanges": [
